title: Founder widens the Gnomon aim to a "Jarvis"-like suite; the S1 plan is reshaped, not enlarged
summary: 'On resuming the boards checkpoint, the founder asked for the plan to scale toward Gnomon as a full "Jarvis"-like suite for building seamlessly, and for the team to iterate through the build overnight. Arky and a Loid/Jinx/Helix counterweight ran in parallel; Aegis reviewed the result. Outcome: S1 stays the same size, but everything permanent (op rows, contract ids, names) is shaped for later mediums.'
